  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We have some captured Irks in the Pen through that door. For study, you understand!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The creatures here are fascinating, blending Schools of Magic as they do. We wanted to understand how they do that.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Unfortunately, to date, all I have learned is that they take great umbrage to me going anywhere near them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Let's go in and see if this Repellant reciprocates the sentiment!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That did not transpire according to my projections. But that's okay! Science is just failing until you succeed.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Alas, the preparations for each potential failure are long and exhaustive. Rottingham mentioned you had some business with him.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Best return to it, I think.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_SteampunkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Phileas_Dogg_NV-NEWV_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546204,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-NEWV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The repellant didn't work? Splendid. Just... splendid. Well, you did your part. I suppose we should discuss your concerns now.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Dog_Governor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Rottingham_Weiler_NV-NEWV_008.mp3",
